---
// Volatility of an equal-weight portfolio of 5 assets, each with 20% volatility, as the pairwise correlation rho rises:
// vol = 20 * sqrt((1 + 4 rho) / 5). rho 0.3 -> 13.3%, rho 0.8 -> 18.3% (Python in the quiz verifiedBy).
const W = 900, H = 340;
const vol = (r: number) => 20 * Math.sqrt((1 + 4 * r) / 5);
const px = (r: number) => 90 + r * 700;
const py = (v: number) => 280 - (v / 20) * 200;
const pts = Array.from({ length: 51 }, (_, i) => { const r = i / 50; return `${px(r).toFixed(1)},${py(vol(r)).toFixed(1)}`; }).join(' ');
---
<figure class="p07f">
  <div class="p07f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A rising curve: volatility of an equal-weight portfolio of five assets, each with 20 percent volatility, against the pairwise correlation from 0 to 1. At correlation 0 the portfolio volatility is 8.9 percent, at 0.3 it is 13.3 percent, at 0.8 it is 18.3 percent, and at 1 it is 20 percent, no diversification at all.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Diversification is borrowed from low correlation</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đa dạng hoá là thứ vay từ tương quan thấp</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Volatility of 5 equal-weight assets, each at 20% on its own, %</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biến động của 5 tài sản chia đều, mỗi tài sản tự nó 20%, %</tspan></text>
    {[0, 10, 20].map((v) => (<g><line x1="80" x2="800" y1={py(v)} y2={py(v)} class="grid" /><text x="72" y={py(v) + 4} text-anchor="end" class="m">{v}</text></g>))}
    <polyline points={pts} class="line-gold" />
    <line x1="80" x2="800" y1={py(20)} y2={py(20)} class="dash" />
    {[0, 0.3, 0.8, 1].map((r) => (<text x={px(r)} y="304" text-anchor="middle" class="m">{r}</text>))}
    <text x="440" y="326" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>pairwise correlation between the assets</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tương quan từng cặp giữa các tài sản</tspan></text>
    <circle cx={px(0.3)} cy={py(vol(0.3))} r="5" class="gold" />
    <text x={px(0.3) - 10} y={py(vol(0.3)) - 14} text-anchor="middle" class="num">{vol(0.3).toFixed(1)}%</text>
    <text x={px(0.3) + 14} y={py(vol(0.3)) + 28} class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>calm market, ρ = 0.3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thị trường êm, ρ = 0,3</tspan></text>
    <circle cx={px(0.8)} cy={py(vol(0.8))} r="5" class="redf" />
    <text x={px(0.8)} y={py(vol(0.8)) + 24} text-anchor="middle" class="num red">{vol(0.8).toFixed(1)}%</text>
    <text x={px(0.8)} y={py(vol(0.8)) + 42} text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>stress, ρ = 0.8</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>căng thẳng, ρ = 0,8</tspan></text>
    <text x="90" y={py(20) - 8} class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>no diversification: 20%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không đa dạng hoá chút nào: 20%</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say five assets with 20% volatility each. When their correlation jumps from 0.3 to 0.8, the same equal-weight basket goes from 13.3% to 18.3% volatility without a single trade.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử năm tài sản, mỗi tài sản 20% biến động. Khi tương quan nhảy từ 0,3 lên 0,8, chính giỏ chia đều ấy tăng từ 13,3% lên 18,3% biến động mà không cần một lệnh nào.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>

  .p07f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p07f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p07f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 600px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p07f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p07f .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07f .sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p07f .m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p07f .lab { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07f .bt { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07f .num { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p07f .num.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .p07f .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p07f .boxred { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p07f .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p07f .arrow { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .p07f .gold { fill: var(--gold); }
  .p07f .grey { fill: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.55; }
  .p07f .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .p07f .line-gold { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.5; fill: none; }
  .p07f .line-red { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.5; fill: none; }
  .p07f .dash { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .p07f .dashred { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .p07f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
